The HLSL-to-MSL translator (Sources/MilkShaders) is original. Its prelude follows MilkDrop 2's documented shader
interface (sampler names, GetBlur1–3, lum, q1–q32, texsize, roam_*, rot_*).

Presets in Presets/ were written for this package and are under its MIT licence (see Presets/README.md). Preset
packs used for testing (Corpus/, git-ignored) are not redistributed.

